   "strokeColor": "#EAF4FF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "item\nid                  PK\nitem_uid            merge hint, INDEXED not unique\nitem_type           'game' \u2014 CHECKed. The whole door-open affordance\nprovider_id + provider_ref     UNIQUE\nacquisition         digital | physical\ntitle \u00b7 sort_title \u00b7 platform\nplaytime_minutes    INT NOT NULL \u2014 zero is a real value\nlast_played_at      NULL = not reported\nsteam_appid \u00b7 achievements_total / _unlocked\nstatus_manual       NULL = derive on read\nstatus_changed_at \u00b7 rating \u00b7 notes\nabsent_since        tombstone \u2014 NEVER a delete\nmerged_into         Phase 4 merge, never rewrites keys",
